    },
    {
      "id": "u_013d20dfd05c43d0468ba49d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To maintain a similar UX to Notion, every property is also turned into __TRILIUM_PH_0__Promoted Attributes__TRILIUM_PH_1__ at collection level. This also makes the columns visible in the table collection. The promoted attributes are made inheritable so that they appear when navigating in the child notes as well.",
      "sourceHash": "013d20dfd05c43d0468ba49dbc5600825e978ec15ebfa57c1ad8dc6c10d990b7",
      "context": "Notion > Databases",
      "contextHash": "c6414b38ab64170e1b48ad88f88e6323eacbd075a2f67ea49ae30765745218b2",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2f023c7622c2662b3d838891_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The names of the labels are intentionally converted to __TRILIUM_PH_0__ to match Trilium's conventions, but the full name of the column is preserved through the __TRILIUM_PH_1__Alias__TRILIUM_PH_2__ mechanism of promoted attributes.",
      "sourceHash": "2f023c7622c2662b3d83889130828b153481977ecfd9f08634d2271793a40d7e",
      "context": "Notion > Databases",
      "contextHash": "c6414b38ab64170e1b48ad88f88e6323eacbd075a2f67ea49ae30765745218b2",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
